<title>UK: Courtaulds Text says progress encouraging.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds Text says progress encouraging.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Courtaulds Textiles said on Tuesday it had so far made encouraging year-on-year progress in the current financial year, particularly in the UK and the U.S.</p>
<p>&quot;Our reorganisation programme remains on schedule and within budget and at this early stage of the year we are comfortably meeting our overall financial targets,&quot; John Eccles, the company chairman, told an annual meeting of shareholders.</p>
<p>Courtaulds is due to announce its interim results on September 10.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
